Checkout UIs:
  ✓ Full page (Recommended)
  ✓ Payment Links
  ✓ Embedded form
  ✓ Payment Element
  ✗ Express Checkout Element
  ✗ Payment Method Messaging Element
  ✓ In-app payments

Products:
  ✗ Managed Payments
  ✓ Billing
  ✓ Invoicing
  ✗ Customer Portal
  ✓ Radar
  ✗ Terminal
  ✓ Connect

